@title Cabinet: a device dragged off the plate and released elsewhere is put down, never stuck to the pointer
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# A press, a drag out over the side panels and a release away from the plate; then a second drag ended by Escape.
# Each time the pointer must be free: moving the mouse afterwards moves nothing. Regression guard for the stuck part.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
move 300 900
shot before
mouse_down 1009 225
move 1050 300
move 1300 400
move 1850 300
wait 5
shot dragging-out
mouse_up 1850 300
wait 10
move 700 900
wait 5
move 760 880
wait 5
shot released-not-stuck
check_layout
mouse_down 1009 225
move 1100 400
key Escape
wait 5
mouse_up 1100 400
wait 5
move 600 900
wait 5
shot escape-not-stuck
check_layout
click 800 900
wait 5
shot clicked-elsewhere
